-Green, deep, all the way down. Red eyes. Hair dark and chopped short and standing straight up, because I cut it myself and then stopped thinking about it, the brows as dark, the mouth black. Ears out past the hair, long and pointed. Two straps, black tights, green in between. I'm on my front, chin on my fists, feet in the air behind me, and the stacks come to my shoulder on both sides of the bed, old ones in cloth and leather. I reach one from here.
