-row's — no name spells one".
-
-So `an ryn code-quality` composes the bare name `ryn`, reattaches her DEFAULT seat row, and pins
-`domain=code-quality`. The departure gets no name, is not separately addressable, and silently
-shares the default seat's row — while `ops agent send ryn` reaches one row either way.
-
